* =================================================================
* FINAL 8x64 Differential 1T1R ReRAM Crossbar - Layer 1
* Architecture: 8 -> 64 -> 5 MLP Classifier
* Technology: SKY130 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 (W=1.0u L=0.15u)
* =================================================================
*
* Conductance range: 0.296 - 99.273 uS (SKY130 ReRAM PDK)
* V_READ = 0.15V, V_GATE = 1.8V
* Scale factor: 1.370490e+05
* Total 1T1R cells: 1024 (differential: 512 pos + 512 neg)
*
* Cell topology (1T1R):
*   row_i --[NMOS D]--[NMOS S]--mid--[R_ReRAM]--col_j
*   NMOS gate tied to VDD (1.8V), deep triode: Vgs~1.8V, Vds~0.15V
*
* Differential encoding:
*   w_ij = scale * (I_col_pos_j - I_col_neg_j)
*
* Usage:
*   1. Set Vrow0..Vrow7 to normalized_feature_i * V_READ
*   2. Run .op analysis
*   3. MAC_j = scale * (i(Vsp_j) - i(Vsn_j))
*   4. hidden_j = ReLU(MAC_j + bias_j)
*   5. Feed hidden layer to Layer 2 (64x5, digital or 2nd crossbar)
*
* Trained on: MIT-BIH DS1 (22 records), Python 8-feature extraction
* Tested on:  MIT-BIH DS2 (22 records), inter-patient protocol
* =================================================================

.include "C:/src/skywater-pdk-libs-sky130_fd_pr/cells/nfet_01v8/sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8__tt.corner.spice"
.include "C:/src/skywater-pdk-libs-sky130_fd_pr/cells/nfet_01v8/sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8__mismatch.corner.spice"

